#: ../../source/fs.walk_README.md:134 ../../source/fs.walk_README.md:146
msgid "Default: `undefined`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/fs.walk_README.md:101
msgid ""
"By default, all paths are built relative to the root path. You can use "
"this option to set custom root path."
